 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "codes lists the distinct registered codes; records lists [timestamp, code, value] in arrival order (timestamps need not be sorted). Records whose code is not registered are ignored. Return one row per distinct timestamp of the remaining records, in increasing timestamp order; a row is [timestamp, v1, ..., vc] with one cell per registered code in code-point order. A cell holds the value of that code at the row timestamp (the last-arriving record wins when one timestamp repeats a code); if the code has no record at that timestamp, the cell carries the latest value of that code from an earlier timestamp, or null when there is none yet.",
  "provenance": [
